                                "sense_id": "6be5ff78-6437-3c55-8258-002a1e1f95a2",
                                "text": "Ashley: You're Dr. Warren, the one in charge of the excavation. Do you know what happened to the beacon?\nDr. Warren: It was moved to the spaceport this morning. Manuel and I stayed behind to help pack up the camp."
